flowchart TB
    CLIENT[Agent application] --> SDK[HTTPS · Python SDK · TypeScript SDK]
    SDK --> API[FastAPI v1]
    API --> AUTH[Authenticate + authorize<br/>tenant · workspace · action]
    AUTH -->|denied| DENY[Safe error<br/>metadata-only audit]
    AUTH -->|allowed| ROUTE{Explicit operation}

    subgraph WRITE[Write path · M1 remember]
        direction LR
        REMEMBER[Remember request] --> VALIDATE[Validate schema<br/>scope + provenance]
        VALIDATE --> ADMIT[Prohibited-content<br/>admission policy]
    end

    ROUTE -->|remember| REMEMBER
    ADMIT -->|rejected| DENY
    ADMIT -->|accepted| KEY

    subgraph NEON[Neon PostgreSQL · canonical authority]
        direction TB
        RLS[Forced tenant row-level security]

        subgraph TX[One atomic transaction]
            direction LR
            KEY[Reserve<br/>idempotency key]
            MEMORY[Logical<br/>memory]
            VERSION[Immutable<br/>version]
            META[Scope · evidence<br/>governance metadata]
            EVENT[Durable<br/>outbox event]
            RECEIPT[Finalize<br/>write receipt]
            KEY --> MEMORY --> VERSION --> META --> EVENT --> RECEIPT
        end

        QUERY[Scoped canonical query<br/>current authorized versions]
        RLS -. protects .-> TX
        RLS -. protects .-> QUERY
    end

    RECEIPT --> ACK[Authoritative acknowledgement<br/>memory ID · version · operation status]

    subgraph READ[Read path · M1 inspect and list]
        direction LR
        INSPECT[Inspect or list] --> FILTER[Filter tenant · workspace<br/>subject · purpose]
        FILTER --> QUERY
        QUERY --> RESULT[Structured memory result<br/>content · provenance · validity]
    end

    ROUTE -->|inspect or list| INSPECT

    EVENT -. asynchronous .-> WORKER[Claim · retry · lease recovery]
    WORKER -. later milestones .-> DERIVED[Rebuildable derivatives<br/>embeddings · summaries · indexes]

    API -. safe metadata .-> AUDIT[Content-free audit telemetry]
    WORKER -. safe metadata .-> AUDIT
    EVAL[M1 golden cases + holdout] -. verifies .-> AUTH
    EVAL -. verifies .-> TX
    EVAL -. verifies .-> QUERY
    EVAL -. verifies .-> RLS

    MIGRATE[Alembic migrations<br/>direct connection] --> NEON
    API -. pooled connection .-> NEON
    WORKER -. pooled connection .-> NEON

